# Line endings. Kotlin sources are LF in this repository: 109 of 116 were LF
# when this file was written, and the 7 that were not caused a whole-file diff
# the moment an agent touched one. Ticket 29 rewrote all 1,392 lines of
# MainActivity.kt for a 53 line change that way, which hides the real change
# from a reviewer and from git blame.
*.kt text eol=lf
*.kts text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf

# Pictures and databases are bytes. A screenshot pair is compared by md5 in this
# project, so nothing may touch them.
*.png binary
*.db binary
*.jks binary
*.keystore binary
